// spellFrame, and what only it reaches
//
// The template of a spelling session's frame: MakeSpellFrame (the native
// side of the spelling checker, src/recognition/Spelling.cpp) clones it
// and puts the address of the session's speller block in `speller`. The
// script holds the session by this frame.

spellFrame := {speller: nil, saveUserDict: nil, dialogInhibit: nil, countskippedasmisspelled: nil};
